  description: "You can only use each of the following effects of \"Therion \"Lily\"
    Borea\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF You can target 1 \"Therion\" monster or 1 Plant
    monster in your GY; Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, equip
    that monster to this card.\r\n\u25CF You can send 1 card from your hand or field
    to the GY; add 1 \"Therion\" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand.\r\nA \"Therion\"
    monster equipped with this card gains 700 ATK, also it can activate the 2nd effect
    listed above as if it were \"Therion \"Lily\" Borea\"."
